olutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-450x450.png 450w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-90x90.png 90w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512.png 512w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" /></a>A small update fixing a bunch of things and updating the database to be compatible with AdRotate Pro 4.0 and up. A number of dashboard tweaks and changes have been included to make the dashboard more uniform and logical to read.</p>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<div class=\"shortcode-unorderedlist arrow\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>[change] Updated database for AdRotate Pro 4.0</li>\n<li>[change] Dashboard tweaks</li>\n<li>[fix] Notification settings not always saving correctly</li>\n<li>[fix] AdRotate Logo path no longer using WP_CONTENT_URL</li>\n<li>[fix] Redirect for using Maintenance functions</li>\n<li>[i18n] New and updated translation strings</li>\n</ul>\n<p></div>\n\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:1;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:48:\"\n		\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n		\n		\n				\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:3:{s:0:\"\";a:6:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:38:\"AdRotate Pro 4.0 – Advertiser update\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:69:\"https://ajdg.solutions/2016/07/18/adrotate-pro-4-0-advertiser-update/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Mon, 18 Jul 2016 03:15:50 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:6:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:15:\"AdRotate Plugin\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:8:\"adrotate\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:12:\"improvements\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:3:\"pro\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:6:\"update\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:9:\"wordpress\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"https://ajdg.solutions/?p=18058\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:319:\"A lot of things happened over the last 2 months. I&#8217;ve been ill quite badly for a few weeks. Which sort of skipped last months update. For the first time in 3 years there wasn&#8217;t a monthly update. My girlfriend moved in which was a emotional rollercoaster and flurry of new routines and changes. And [&#8230;]\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:5:\"Arnan\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:6162:\"<p><a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512.png\" rel=\"lightbox-0\"><img src=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-100x100.png\" alt=\"logo-512x512\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"alignleft size-thumbnail wp-image-699\" srcset=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-100x100.png 100w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-300x300.png 300w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-150x150.png 150w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-200x200.png 200w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-450x450.png 450w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-90x90.png 90w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512.png 512w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" /></a>A lot of things happened over the last 2 months. I&#8217;ve been ill quite badly for a few weeks. Which sort of skipped last months update. For the first time in 3 years there wasn&#8217;t a monthly update. My girlfriend moved in which was a emotional rollercoaster and flurry of new routines and changes. And in between I slowly worked on AdRotate updates &#8211; But not much came of it.</p>\n<h2>Advertisers! Advertisers! Advertisers!</h2>\n<p>But, behold! AdRotate Pro 4.0 is here. About time we bumped the version from 3 to 4. This update has a heavy focus on advertisers and dashboard improvements. You&#8217;ll notice that there is a new Advertiser dashboard where you can manage advertisers more easily. This also means that you can now create a user, mark them as advertiser but not necessarily assign an advert to them. And more importantly, you can now give permissions per advertiser. The global toggles are still there, but if enabled you can now turn them off per advertiser if you so please. This gives you much more fine-grained control of who does what.</p>\n<p>AdRotate Pro should seek out and update current users and convert the relevant ones into new Advertisers, but check the settings anyway. You can do so in each users profile &#8211; I&#8217;ve added a bunch of checkboxes for permissions at the bottom. And you can check the new &#8220;Manager Advertisers&#8221; dashboard.</p>\n<h2>Payment system</h2>\n<p>I&#8217;ve made some headway with a easy to use payment system. Then got properly stuck and took that (mostly) out for now. I&#8217;ve sort of underestimated the complexity of the whole thing and what kind of impact it would have on how AdRotate Pro functions. So I&#8217;m going to give that some more thought and work on a more thought out integration in near(-ish) future upgrades.</p>\n<p>I&#8217;m thinking of a 2 way system where you can make payment orders from the dashboard, without necessarily involving an advert and a way which goes right in the flow of creating an advert. If you have ideas for how this should work, let me know!</p>\n<h2>Cloudflare</h2>\n<p>AdRotate Pro now supports Cloudflares Geo IP header. I&#8217;m not entirely sure how this stacks up against their caching stuff. It seems to work for me. So that&#8217;s an experiment for now. I&#8217;m looking forward to your feedback on that.</p>\n<h2>Notifications</h2>\n<p>The notification system got a bit of a overhaul. Email notifications can be much more informative and useful. Check out the settings for that. Also the dashboard notifications have been updated a bit to provide better and more accurate information.</p>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<div class=\"shortcode-unorderedlist arrow\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>[new] CloudFlare Geo Support for countries</li>\n<li>[new] Advertiser overview and management options</li>\n<li>[new] Per advertiser permissions</li>\n<li>[new] Much more error states in the notification bar</li>\n<li>[new] Re-did email notifications to be more informative</li>\n<li>[fix] Mobile icons not always correct for advertiser dashboard</li>\n<li>[fix] Redirect for using Maintenance functions</li>\n<li>[fix] Notification for support emails not always working</li>\n<li>[fix] No longer list archived and binned adverts in groups</li>\n<li>[fix] CPM for single adverts now counted correctly</li>\n<li>[fix] Can no longer select the same group as fallback</li>\n<li>[fix] No longer list archived and binned adverts in schedules</li>\n<li>[fix] Geo Targeting for advertisers now saves correctly</li>\n<li>[change] Better asset control for advertisers</li>\n<li>[change] Responsive feature depreciated, use mobile feature instead</li>\n<li>[change] Smaller geo cookie/$_SESSION header</li>\n<li>[change] Updated push notifications to be more informative</li>\n<li>[change] Impression spread is now per hour instead of per day</li>\n<li>[change] Dashboard tweaks</li>\n<li>[i18n] New and updated translation strings</li>\n</ul>\n<p></div>\n\n<h2>Meet the girlfriend!</h2>\n<p>And here she is, my fancy <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/montalban.jovelyn\" target=\"_blank\">Jovelyn</a> who likes goats! We went to a beach in Dauin (Near Dumaguete) a while ago and this is what we found on the way back.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/jovelyn-touches-a-goat.jpg\" rel=\"lightbox-1\"><img src=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/jovelyn-touches-a-goat-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"jovelyn-touches-a-goat\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-18059\" srcset=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/jovelyn-touches-a-goat-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/jovelyn-touches-a-goat-100x100.jpg 100w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/jovelyn-touches-a-goat-300x300.jpg 300w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/jovelyn-touches-a-goat-768x768.jpg 768w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/jovelyn-touches-a-goat-200x200.jpg 200w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/jovelyn-touches-a-goat-260x260.jpg 260w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/jovelyn-touches-a-goat-380x380.jpg 380w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/jovelyn-touches-a-goat.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></a></p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:2;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:48:\"\n		\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n		\n		\n				\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:3:{s:0:\"\";a:6:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:28:\"AdRotate Pro and advertisers\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:63:\"https://ajdg.solutions/2016/06/08/adrotate-pro-and-advertisers/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Wed, 08 Jun 2016 11:48:13 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:6:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:15:\"AdRotate Plugin\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:8:\"adrotate\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:11:\"development\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:12:\"improvements\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:14:\"online payment\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:3:\"pro\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"https://ajdg.solutions/?p=17061\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:323:\"Over the past week I&#8217;ve been working on a big new feature &#8211; Or a bunch of features. We may even bump the version to version 4.0&#8230; How about that? The new stuff is focused on managing advertisers and expand on the possibilities there. I&#8217;ve included a few draft screenshots so you can make up [&#8230;]\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:5:\"Arnan\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:6023:\"<p><a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512.png\" rel=\"lightbox-0\"><img src=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-100x100.png\" alt=\"logo-512x512\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"alignleft size-thumbnail wp-image-699\" srcset=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-100x100.png 100w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-300x300.png 300w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-150x150.png 150w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-200x200.png 200w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-450x450.png 450w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-90x90.png 90w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512.png 512w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" /></a>Over the past week I&#8217;ve been working on a big new feature &#8211; Or a bunch of features. We may even bump the version to version 4.0&#8230; How about that? The new stuff is focused on managing advertisers and expand on the possibilities there. I&#8217;ve included a few draft screenshots so you can make up your mind about it and chime in with ideas or comments. If you have any, comment below or use the contact form <img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/72x72/1f642.png\" alt=\"&#x1f642;\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\" /> thanks!</p>\n<h2>Some screenshots</h2>\n<p>Remember, these are drafts and can change &#8211; Though I&#8217;m fairly confident this will be the final format (mostly). Basically what you see there is a new menu, the advertiser overview and a profile.<br />\nThe profile bit will be tied in to the normal WP users stuff. And that allows us to set permissions/options per user instead of the global switch you have now. This basically allows for a greater level of control.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-menu.png\" rel=\"lightbox-1\"><img src=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-menu-100x100.png\" alt=\"adrotate-advertiser-menu\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"alignleft size-thumbnail wp-image-17065\" srcset=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-menu-100x100.png 100w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-menu-200x200.png 200w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-menu-260x260.png 260w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" /></a> <a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-dash.png\" rel=\"lightbox-2\"><img src=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-dash-100x100.png\" alt=\"adrotate-advertiser-dash\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"alignleft size-thumbnail wp-image-17062\" srcset=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-dash-100x100.png 100w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-dash-200x200.png 200w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-dash-260x260.png 260w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" /></a> <a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-profile.png\" rel=\"lightbox-3\"><img src=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-profile-100x100.png\" alt=\"adrotate-advertiser-profile\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"alignleft size-thumbnail wp-image-17064\" srcset=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-profile-100x100.png 100w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-profile-200x200.png 200w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-profile-260x260.png 260w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-profile-380x380.png 380w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" /></a> <a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-adduser.png\" rel=\"lightbox-4\"><img src=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-adduser-100x100.png\" alt=\"adrotate-advertiser-adduser\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"alignleft size-thumbnail wp-image-17063\" srcset=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-adduser-100x100.png 100w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-adduser-200x200.png 200w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-adduser-260x260.png 260w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/adrotate-advertiser-adduser-380x380.png 380w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" /></a></p>\n<h2>Payment options</h2>\n<p>I&#8217;m a bit scared to add a Paypal API. Their stuff is quite complex and I have zero experience with their services API <img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/72x72/1f641.png\" alt=\"&#x1f641;\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\" /> I do know how certain other payment systems work (<a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/products/merchant-esolutions-for-woocommerce/\">Merchant E-Solutions</a> and <a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/products/omnikassa-for-woocommerce/\">Omnikassa</a>) and I sell plugins for those. But Paypal is something different &#8211; And I can&#8217;t rely on WooCommerce this time&#8230;<br />\nSo maybe adding payment options has to wait till a later iteration. But the basics are taking shape just fine. Manual payments can be replaced by automated ones in a future version if I don&#8217;t feel comfortable with Paypal just yet.</p>\n<p>I&#8217;m currently not considering other payment options. Adding other payment gateways will please only a few. I can support Stripe, but then people want Braintree (or whatever). If I support both the system gets more bloated with every line of code. So far pretty much everyone requested Paypal support. For now it&#8217;s not worth it to spend a lot of time to integrate multiple systems.</p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:3;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:48:\"\n		\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n		\n		\n				\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:3:{s:0:\"\";a:6:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:38:\"AdRotate Free 3.15.4 – Available now\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:69:\"https://ajdg.solutions/2016/05/30/adrotate-free-3-15-4-available-now/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Mon, 30 May 2016 06:55:50 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:6:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:15:\"AdRotate Plugin\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:8:\"adrotate\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:4:\"free\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:12:\"improvements\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:6:\"update\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:9:\"wordpress\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"https://ajdg.solutions/?p=16797\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:361:\"A small update fixing (or adding, rather) support for when your wp-content folder has a different name. Apparently people still think that changing that folder makes things more secure and it is done more and more often. Anyway, AdRotate Free now supports this. Some other tweaks and minor changes under the hood including updated internationalisation [&#8230;]\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:5:\"Arnan\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:2388:\"<p><a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512.png\" rel=\"lightbox-0\"><img src=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-100x100.png\" alt=\"logo-512x512\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"alignleft size-thumbnail wp-image-699\" srcset=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-100x100.png 100w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-300x300.png 300w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-150x150.png 150w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-200x200.png 200w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-450x450.png 450w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-90x90.png 90w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512.png 512w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" /></a>A small update fixing (or adding, rather) support for when your wp-content folder has a different name. Apparently people still think that changing that folder makes things more secure and it is done more and more often. Anyway, AdRotate Free now supports this.</p>\n<p>Some other tweaks and minor changes under the hood including updated internationalisation files are included in this release.</p>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<div class=\"shortcode-unorderedlist arrow\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>[new] Support for if the wp-content folder has a different name</li>\n</ul>\n<p></div>\n\n<h2>Winter is coming</h2>\n<p>For all you westerners Summer is coming soon(ish). For me winter is coming. Which means, temperatures between 25-35 degrees celsius instead of having them between 30-35 degrees.<br />\nAlso there <em>may</em> be a bit more rain. Emphasis on may&#8230;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/batangas-port.jpg\" rel=\"lightbox-1\"><img src=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/batangas-port-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"batangas-port\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-16798\" srcset=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/batangas-port-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/batangas-port-300x225.jpg 300w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/batangas-port-768x576.jpg 768w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/batangas-port.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></a></p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:4;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:48:\"\n		\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n		\n		\n				\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:3:{s:0:\"\";a:6:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:38:\"AdRotate Pro 3.22.1 – Bugfix release\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:69:\"https://ajdg.solutions/2016/05/17/adrotate-pro-3-22-1-bugfix-release/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Tue, 17 May 2016 03:45:07 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:6:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:15:\"AdRotate Plugin\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:8:\"adrotate\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:6:\"bugfix\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:12:\"improvements\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:3:\"pro\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:9:\"wordpress\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"https://ajdg.solutions/?p=16410\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:360:\"A quick update fixing 2 small bugs. Adding/editing adverts now works again. And the advertiser name is no longer blank in the moderation queue for some setups. Changes A colourful display You&#8217;ll find these bushes all over the Philippines and many Filipino&#8217;s don&#8217;t really pay attention to them. But I think it&#8217;s a pretty sight. [&#8230;]\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:5:\"Arnan\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:2506:\"<p><a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512.png\" rel=\"lightbox-0\"><img src=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-100x100.png\" alt=\"logo-512x512\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"alignleft size-thumbnail wp-image-699\" srcset=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-100x100.png 100w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-300x300.png 300w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-150x150.png 150w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-200x200.png 200w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-450x450.png 450w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-90x90.png 90w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512.png 512w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" /></a>A quick update fixing 2 small bugs. Adding/editing adverts now works again. And the advertiser name is no longer blank in the moderation queue for some setups.</p>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<div class=\"shortcode-unorderedlist arrow\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>[fix] Folder list not working when adding/editing adverts</li>\n<li>[fix] Advertiser name blank in moderation queue</li>\n</ul>\n<p></div>\n\n<h2>A colourful display</h2>\n<p>You&#8217;ll find these bushes all over the Philippines and many Filipino&#8217;s don&#8217;t really pay attention to them. But I think it&#8217;s a pretty sight. There is a smaller one in my garden, too <img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/72x72/1f642.png\" alt=\"&#x1f642;\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/flower-bush.jpg\" rel=\"lightbox-1\"><img src=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/flower-bush.jpg\" alt=\"flower-bush\" width=\"960\" height=\"960\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-16412\" srcset=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/flower-bush.jpg 960w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/flower-bush-100x100.jpg 100w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/flower-bush-300x300.jpg 300w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/flower-bush-768x768.jpg 768w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/flower-bush-200x200.jpg 200w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/flower-bush-260x260.jpg 260w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/flower-bush-380x380.jpg 380w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" /></a></p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:5;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:48:\"\n		\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n		\n		\n				\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:3:{s:0:\"\";a:6:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:41:\"AdRotate Pro 3.22 – Maintenance release\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:72:\"https://ajdg.solutions/2016/05/16/adrotate-pro-3-22-maintenance-release/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Mon, 16 May 2016 09:28:34 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:6:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:15:\"AdRotate Plugin\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:8:\"adrotate\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:6:\"bugfix\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:12:\"improvements\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:3:\"pro\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:9:\"wordpress\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"https://ajdg.solutions/?p=16394\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:332:\"A small but important update for AdRotate Pro. This version improves the pathing for assets and banner images. Paths were not used very consistently. With the help and feedback of some users this was greatly improved for non-standard setups where the wp-content folder or the entire site is not in the root of your hosting [&#8230;]\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:5:\"Arnan\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:3073:\"<p><a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512.png\" rel=\"lightbox-0\"><img src=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-100x100.png\" alt=\"logo-512x512\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"alignleft size-thumbnail wp-image-699\" srcset=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-100x100.png 100w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-300x300.png 300w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-150x150.png 150w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-200x200.png 200w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-450x450.png 450w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-90x90.png 90w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512.png 512w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" /></a>A small but important update for AdRotate Pro. This version improves the pathing for assets and banner images. Paths were not used very consistently. With the help and feedback of some users this was greatly improved for non-standard setups where the wp-content folder or the entire site is not in the root of your hosting space.</p>\n<p>Post Injection appeared broken for some setups. Some of the code determining the site id variable didn&#8217;t work reliably, or not at all. This has been fixed. Some other small under the hood tweaks have been made, most notably to the code comments and layout of settings dashboards.</p>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<div class=\"shortcode-unorderedlist arrow\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>[update] General tab settings layout</li>\n<li>[fix] More consistent paths for banner assets</li>\n<li>[fix] More reliable Post Injection for multisites</li>\n</ul>\n<p></div>\n\n<h2>Alona Beach</h2>\n<p>Sometimes called the &#8216;Poor man&#8217;s Boracay&#8217;. There is nothing poor about this place. Hotels and resorts are available in all price ranges. And most cheaper/mid-range ones use photoshopped pics to look like the more high-end resorts. Yea&#8230; Do your research before booking.<br />\nBut, the beach is nice. Just not as nice as the many pictures you&#8217;ll find in &#8216;official&#8217; resources.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/alona-beach.jpg\" rel=\"lightbox-1\"><img src=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/alona-beach.jpg\" alt=\"alona-beach\" width=\"960\" height=\"960\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-16395\" srcset=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/alona-beach.jpg 960w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/alona-beach-100x100.jpg 100w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/alona-beach-300x300.jpg 300w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/alona-beach-768x768.jpg 768w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/alona-beach-200x200.jpg 200w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/alona-beach-260x260.jpg 260w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/alona-beach-380x380.jpg 380w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" /></a></p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:6;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:48:\"\n		\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n		\n		\n				\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:3:{s:0:\"\";a:6:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:49:\"Omnikassa for WooCommerce 1.3.5 – Available now\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:80:\"https://ajdg.solutions/2016/05/16/omnikassa-for-woocommerce-1-3-5-available-now/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Mon, 16 May 2016 06:06:54 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:6:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:23:\"Payment Gateway Plugins\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:12:\"improvements\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:9:\"omnikassa\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:8:\"rabobank\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:6:\"update\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:11:\"woocommerce\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"https://ajdg.solutions/?p=16380\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:339:\"A small maintenance update cleaning up some code behind the scenes and less code comments. The plugin has been updated to use Update API 4, which works faster and more reliable. Changes Lighthouses They&#8217;re not very common in the Philippines. Unlike Europe, where you see them everywhere where ships go. This one and a bunch [&#8230;]\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:5:\"Arnan\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:2496:\"<p><a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/wc-omnicard-logo.jpg\" rel=\"lightbox-0\"><img src=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/wc-omnicard-logo-100x100.jpg\" alt=\"wc-omnicard-logo\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"alignleft size-thumbnail wp-image-1021\" srcset=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/wc-omnicard-logo-100x100.jpg 100w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/wc-omnicard-logo-300x300.jpg 300w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/wc-omnicard-logo-150x150.jpg 150w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/wc-omnicard-logo-260x260.jpg 260w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2013/02/wc-omnicard-logo.jpg 380w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" /></a>A small maintenance update cleaning up some code behind the scenes and less code comments. The plugin has been updated to use Update API 4, which works faster and more reliable.</p>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<div class=\"shortcode-unorderedlist arrow\">\n<ul>\n<li>[update] Now uses update API v4</li>\n<li>[update] Updated credit links</li>\n<li>[update] Slight code tweaks &#038; comments cleanup</li>\n</ul>\n<p></div>\n\n<h2>Lighthouses</h2>\n<p>They&#8217;re not very common in the Philippines. Unlike Europe, where you see them everywhere where ships go. This one and a bunch others are what&#8217;s left of the few that where here. Now it&#8217;s all GPS towers and beacons. Which you see dotted around most larger islands with a port.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/guimaras-guisi-lighthouse.jpg\" rel=\"lightbox-1\"><img src=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/guimaras-guisi-lighthouse.jpg\" alt=\"guimaras-guisi-lighthouse\" width=\"960\" height=\"960\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-16383\" srcset=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/guimaras-guisi-lighthouse.jpg 960w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/guimaras-guisi-lighthouse-100x100.jpg 100w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/guimaras-guisi-lighthouse-300x300.jpg 300w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/guimaras-guisi-lighthouse-768x768.jpg 768w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/guimaras-guisi-lighthouse-200x200.jpg 200w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/guimaras-guisi-lighthouse-260x260.jpg 260w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/guimaras-guisi-lighthouse-380x380.jpg 380w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" /></a></p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:7;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:48:\"\n		\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n		\n		\n				\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:3:{s:0:\"\";a:6:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:54:\"Got AdRotate Pro? You no longer need the free version!\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:87:\"https://ajdg.solutions/2016/04/28/got-adrotate-pro-you-no-longer-need-the-free-version/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Thu, 28 Apr 2016 12:39:01 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:6:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:15:\"AdRotate Plugin\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:8:\"adrotate\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:7:\"manuals\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:3:\"pro\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:7:\"support\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:9:\"wordpress\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"https://ajdg.solutions/?p=15702\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:312:\"People ask me more and more if they can remove the free version of AdRotate after buying AdRotate Pro. The short answer; Yes you can. And in more detail, yes but&#8230; If you simply disable the free version and leave it be, that&#8217;s fine. But many like to remove the plugin. Which is better. Every [&#8230;]\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:5:\"Arnan\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:2886:\"<p><a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/products/adrotate-for-wordpress/\"><img src=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-100x100.png\" alt=\"logo-512x512\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"alignleft size-thumbnail wp-image-699\" srcset=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-100x100.png 100w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-300x300.png 300w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-150x150.png 150w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-200x200.png 200w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-450x450.png 450w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-90x90.png 90w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512.png 512w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" /></a>People ask me more and more if they can remove the free version of AdRotate after buying AdRotate Pro.</p>\n<p>The short answer; Yes you can.</p>\n<p>And in more detail, yes but&#8230; If you simply disable the free version and leave it be, that&#8217;s fine. But many like to remove the plugin. Which is better.</p>\n<p>Every purchase of an AdRotate Pro license comes with a readme file which has a step-by-step manual on how to upgrade to AdRotate Pro and what to do with the free version.<br />\nThere is also a guide in the <a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/manuals/adrotate-manuals/\">AdRotate Manuals</a> section which you can get to via this direct link: <a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/manuals/adrotate-manuals/upgrade-adrotate-to-adrotate-pro/\">ajdg.solutions/manuals/adrotate-manuals/upgrade-adrotate-to-adrotate-pro/</a>.</p>\n<h2>Paradise found?</h2>\n<p>Just when you think you find a nice quiet beach for a swim and you&#8217;re constantly stung by shrimps&#8230; <img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/72x72/1f641.png\" alt=\"&#x1f641;\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/sinapsapan-beach.jpg\" rel=\"lightbox-0\"><img src=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/sinapsapan-beach.jpg\" alt=\"sinapsapan-beach\" width=\"960\" height=\"960\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-15705\" srcset=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/sinapsapan-beach.jpg 960w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/sinapsapan-beach-100x100.jpg 100w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/sinapsapan-beach-300x300.jpg 300w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/sinapsapan-beach-768x768.jpg 768w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/sinapsapan-beach-200x200.jpg 200w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/sinapsapan-beach-260x260.jpg 260w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/sinapsapan-beach-380x380.jpg 380w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" /></a></p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:8;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:48:\"\n		\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n\n		\n		\n				\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:3:{s:0:\"\";a:6:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:56:\"Merchant E-Solutions for WooCommerce 1.1.2 now available\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i