oads/2014/06/logo-512x512-200x200.png 200w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-450x450.png 450w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512-90x90.png 90w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/logo-512x512.png 512w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" /></a>A small update fixing a few things in AdRotate Free. As part of the upcoming AdRotate Switch overhaul extra support for that has been built in, too.</p>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<div class=\"shortcode-unorderedlist arrow\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>[fix] Demo adverts schedules created correctly</li>\n<li>[fix] Widget padding setting using current class</li>\n</ul>\n<p></div>\n\n<h2>Flying shark</h2>\n<p>There was a shark on the loose in Molo, Iloilo City. It took me quite a white to get a &#8216;decent&#8217; picture of the balloon frolicking about. When I finally caught it, it was already quite high up.<br />\n<a href=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/floating-shark.jpg\" rel=\"lightbox-0\"><img src=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/floating-shark.jpg\" alt=\"floating-shark\" width=\"960\" height=\"960\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-15498\" srcset=\"https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/floating-shark.jpg 960w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/floating-shark-100x100.jpg 100w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/floating-shark-300x300.jpg 300w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/floating-shark-768x768.jpg 768w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/floating-shark-200x200.jpg 200w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/floating-shark-260x260.jpg 260w, https://ajdg.solutions/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/floating-shark-380x380.jpg 380w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" /></a></p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}}}s:27:\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\";a: